1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,850
Position the rooftop unit above the clear roof opening.

2
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:01,700
Align the sealing gasket around the roof cutout.

3
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:02,500
Center the unit and confirm the mounting direction.

4
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:03,300
Insert fasteners and tighten each point evenly.

5
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,300
Confirm every corner is secured before wiring.

6
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,400
Route the protected power cable into the cabin.

7
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,650
Connect 12V power through a fuse near the battery.

8
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:08,000
Power on, check cool airflow, and verify the roof seal.